guide completionist-horde/attune-sewer-key
title Dalaran Sewer Key (City of Dalaran key)
faction Horde
levels 33-35
category Dungeons
folder Completionist attunements and keys
zone Alterac Mountains
pitch Dalaran Sewer Key: Opens the gate of the Horde's way into the City of Dalaran; one key opens it for the group. The Image of Archmage Modera gives it with Heart of Disruption: keep that quest in your log until you are inside. The Alliance walks in through the sewer pipe in Cantrips & Crows.
why Opens the gate of the Horde's way into the City of Dalaran; one key opens it for the group. The Image of Archmage Modera gives it with Heart of Disruption: keep that quest in your log until you are inside. The Alliance walks in through the sewer pipe in Cantrips & Crows.
